1
00:00:00,070 --> 00:00:03,230
The US Army once bombed a volcano.

2
00:00:03,520 --> 00:00:04,593
And that's not even the

3
00:00:04,613 --> 00:00:06,480
craziest way we fought lava.

4
00:00:06,940 --> 00:00:09,420
1935, Hawaii.

5
00:00:09,670 --> 00:00:12,070
Lava is crawling toward a city.

6
00:00:12,300 --> 00:00:13,130
The plan?

7
00:00:13,310 --> 00:00:14,260
Bombers.

8
00:00:14,500 --> 00:00:16,840
Planned by… George Patton.

9
00:00:17,070 --> 00:00:19,650
Six days later, the lava stops.

10
00:00:19,870 --> 00:00:20,690
Victory?

11
00:00:20,880 --> 00:00:22,282
Scientists still argue whether

12
00:00:22,302 --> 00:00:24,060
the bombs did anything.

13
00:00:24,630 --> 00:00:26,860
1992, Italy.

14
00:00:27,090 --> 00:00:29,230
Etna is coming for a town.

15
00:00:29,400 --> 00:00:30,540
Dirt walls?

16
00:00:30,720 --> 00:00:32,740
The lava climbs right over.

17
00:00:32,950 --> 00:00:34,489
So engineers blow up its

18
00:00:34,509 --> 00:00:36,490
tunnel — at the source.

19
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:39,080
The town loses… one building.

20
00:00:39,300 --> 00:00:41,740
But Iceland went full crazy.

21
00:00:42,180 --> 00:00:43,810
1973.

22
00:00:44,010 --> 00:00:45,619
The ground rips open on an

23
00:00:45,639 --> 00:00:48,600
island of 5,300 people.

24
00:00:48,780 --> 00:00:51,590
Six hours — almost everyone's out.

25
00:00:51,760 --> 00:00:54,520
Then the lava turns toward the harbor.

26
00:00:54,710 --> 00:00:57,650
So they fight a volcano… with the ocean.

27
00:00:57,830 --> 00:00:59,090
Five months.

28
00:00:59,110 --> 00:01:01,700
Seven billion liters of seawater.

29
00:01:01,910 --> 00:01:04,131
The lava stops about 100 meters

30
00:01:04,151 --> 00:01:05,720
from closing the harbor.

31
00:01:05,910 --> 00:01:06,836
And the new rock made

32
00:01:06,856 --> 00:01:08,690
the harbor even better.

33
00:01:08,880 --> 00:01:09,900
Final score:

34
00:01:10,070 --> 00:01:11,240
Humans two.

35
00:01:11,260 --> 00:01:12,970
Volcano zero.

36
00:01:13,190 --> 00:01:14,060
And Hawaii?

37
00:01:14,350 --> 00:01:15,900
We don't talk about Hawaii.
